<title>UK: ING Bank adds 500 mln guilders to Feb 2006 bond.</title>
<headline>ING Bank adds 500 mln guilders to Feb 2006 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible subordinated bond has been launched, lead manager ING Barings said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ING BANK NV</p>
<p> AMT  * 500 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    09.FEB.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.115   PAY DATE ** 22.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    98.54     SPREAD	+50 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    * FUNGIBLE WITH OUTSTANDING 500 MLN DFL BOND</p>
<p>	   ** PLUS 253 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-50-1M   SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  NETHER    TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.425     SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND JUNE 2006 DSL</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE 40 DAYS AFTER PAYMENT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
